OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch investigation after
OL,4,Agull shot dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have begun an investigation
OL,7,Fafter a gull was shot and killed during
OL,8,Fthe early hours of the morning.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said the bird was
OL,11,Ffatally wounded by an air weapon in the
OL,12,Farea of Park Road, Lowestoft at about
OL,13,F04:00 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FUnder the Wildlife and Countryside Act
OL,16,F1981, it is "illegal to intentionally
OL,17,Fkill, injure or take any wild bird" in
OL,18,FGreat Britain without a licence.
